         "answer": {
          "short": "$1289\\text{ cm}^3$",
          "worked": "Using the unrounded angle,\n$$\\begin{align*}A&=\\frac12(9)(12)\\sin\\!\\left(\\cos^{-1}\\!\\left(-\\frac{8}{27}\\right)\\right)\\\\A&=2\\sqrt{665}\\text{ cm}^2\\\\V&=2\\sqrt{665}\\times25\\\\V&=50\\sqrt{665}\\text{ cm}^3\\\\V&\\approx1289\\text{ cm}^3\\end{align*}$$"
         }
        }
       ],
